yantra_wasm.wasm
  Corresponding source: https://github.com/paramtatv/sassembly at tag v1.0.2 (commit b86a24ee576f2bd3a0b4e207bb6d724724f132b3),
  crate crates/yantra-wasm (it includes the in-memory patra file root).
  Toolchain: rustup toolchain install 1.94.0 && rustup target add --toolchain 1.94.0 wasm32-unknown-unknown.
  Build: in a checkout of that tag placed at /tmp/sassembly (cargo hashes a path dependency's absolute path into symbol
  names, so the path is part of the recipe), in crates/yantra-wasm:
  cargo +1.94.0 build --release --locked --target wasm32-unknown-unknown, with
  RUSTFLAGS=--remap-path-prefix=/tmp/sassembly=/sassembly --remap-path-prefix=$HOME/.cargo=/cargo --remap-path-prefix=$HOME/.rustup=/rustup
  and no other environment variables (no CARGO_TARGET_DIR, no other RUSTFLAGS).
  sha256 of this file: a4df01c2aada6d966c7fac1ed288c03a230e2d420d62930dc82f565520b63c98 (two independent clones built at that path agree)

